{"articleNo":"2000","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2000&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년도 수시 모집 원서접수 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.09.05","hit":"21266","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p align=\"center\"><!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 15pt\">◎ 2012학년도 수시 모집 원서접수 안내 ◎&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1. 원서접수기간 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">: <strong>2011. 09. 15(목) 09:00 ～ 20(화) 18:00</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 인터넷으로만 원서접수</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2. 원서접수처</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① 유웨이(www.uwayapply.com) ☞<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;<span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; <a href=\"http://ipsi6.uwayapply.com/susi2/kumoh/?CHA=1\" target=\"_blank\"><img border=\"0\" alt=\"\" src=\"http://wwwimg.uwayapply.com/BANNER/APPLY/IMG/banner_42_1_1.gif\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\"></a>\n</span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">② 진학사(WWW.jinhakapply.com) ☞&nbsp;<a href=\"http://www.jinhakapply.com/frame103829.aspx\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/file/upload/Image/s1_ap_mv4.gif\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\"></a>&nbsp; <a href=\"http://www.jinhakapply.com/frame103830.aspx\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/file/upload/Image/s2_ap_mv4.gif\" width=\"150\" height=\"40\"></a>&nbsp; </span></p>\n\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 성적 반영방법 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 각 전형유형별 성적반영방법 참조</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 구술면접고사 실시</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">4. 지원자격(일부 발췌)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 전형유형별 최저학력 기준 있음</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 교과성적우수자 : 전문계고교 출신자 지원불가</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 기능 특기자 : 기능올림픽대회에서 입상한자(기능경진대회 등은&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 해당없음)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 지역사랑인재 : 일반계고교 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">졸업(예정)자만</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 지원가능</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 농.어촌학생 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">읍.면지역</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">만 농.어촌으로 인정</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -149.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 149.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 전문계고교 졸업자 : 전문계고교 졸업(예정)자 모두지원 가능 </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -149.9pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 149.9pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;단, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">동일계열이</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">라고 인정되는 모집단위</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -13.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">5. 수시 1차와 수시 2차간의 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">복수지원 가 능</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -13.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 단, 하나의 수시 1차와 수시 2차에서 각 하나의 모집단위에 지원하여야<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;한다.)</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -17.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 17.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">6. 수시모집 합격자는 등록하지 않더라도 본교 및 타 대학의 “정시”모집에&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>지원할 수 없음</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -17.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 17.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">7. 수시모집 합격자 중 성적우수 장학금 대상자는 수능을 필히 응시하여야 한다.&nbsp; </span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -17.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 17.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※ 성적우수 장학생 선발은 정시의 성적반영 기준에 의해 선발함.\n</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: -17.5pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 17.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">8. 수시모집 전형 중 국가유공자 및 기회균형할당제 전형은 전형료 면제<br>(단, 접수수수료는 본인 부담) </span></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
